{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">天文台凌晨1時10分改發九號烈風或暴風風力增強信號，<span style='color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, \"sans-serif\", \"microsoft jhenghei\";'>預料本港風力顯著增強。現時切勿外出，遠離當風的門窗，在安全的地方躲避。</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-25T17:19:21.046421+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":62,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}